 "intro_zh": "天目湖因属天目山余脉，故名“天目湖”。天目湖全区拥有300平方公里的生态保护区，区内坐落着沙河、大溪两座国家级大型水库。天目湖地区物产丰富，有沙河桂茗绿茶、乌龙茶、珍珠栗、桂元栗、砂锅鱼头等。",
 "intro_en": "Tianmu Lake is named \"Tianmu Lake\" because it belongs to the remnants of Tianmu Mountain. The entire Tianmu Lake area has an ecological protection zone of 300 square kilometers. There are two large national-level reservoirs, Shahe and Daxi, in the area. Tianmu Lake area is rich in products, including Shahe Guiming green tea, oolong tea, pearl chestnut, Guiyuan chestnut, casserole fish head, etc.",
 "intro_en_source": "machine_translation",
